      <CoiStatement>Declarations. Ethics approval and consent to participate: The study protocol, along with any amendments, informed consent, and the patient information brochure, underwent thorough review and received approval. Ethical approval for this study has been granted by the review committee (CHEC2022-226) and has been documented with the ethics committees of the participating centers. The study will be conducted in strict adherence to local laws and regulations, following the ethical principles outlined in the Declaration of Helsinki, and in accordance with the Good Clinical Practice (GCP) principles for clinical trials. Patient and public involvement: Patients and/or the public were not involved in the design, or conduct, or reporting, or dissemination plans of this research. Informed consent: Potential participants will be notified by the urologist. Informed consent(Supplementary Material S1) will be obtained from all participants and co-signed by the clinician providing the patient information. Competing interests: The authors declare no competing interests.</CoiStatement>
